{"id":"621690","name":"白菜蒜苗水饺","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/621690/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"紫薯粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"粉色是紫薯粉合面，白色是清水合面，醒20分钟。","img":"images/621690/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪肉切粒，放蚝油、生抽、姜末拌匀腌制30分钟。","img":"images/621690/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜苗洗净。","img":"images/621690/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切好备用。","img":"images/621690/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"白菜切好。","img":"images/621690/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"所有食材放在一起。","img":"images/621690/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放盐、芝麻油、花椒油拌匀。","img":"images/621690/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"紫薯面团擀薄，把白色面团包起来，切成均匀的剂子。","img":"images/621690/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成饺子皮。","img":"images/621690/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入馅料收口。","img":"images/621690/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"全部包好。","img":"images/621690/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅内加水烧开。","img":"images/621690/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"下入饺子。","img":"images/621690/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大火烧开转中火煮4分钟。","img":"images/621690/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"捞出。","img":"images/621690/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"美味饺子。","img":"images/621690/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"好看又好吃。","img":"images/621690/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}